1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,378
Which Gemini model should you use?

2
00:00:02,378 --> 00:00:09,933
Gemini 4 Neon joins seven other models, measured on the same questions through the same Gemini API endpoint.

3
00:00:09,933 --> 00:00:13,361
Answer four questions, and stop at the first yes.

4
00:00:13,961 --> 00:00:15,370
Question one.

5
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:20,249
Must it be free, or run on your own hardware?

6
00:00:20,249 --> 00:00:22,201
Use Gemma 4, 31 B.

7
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:28,815
It scored 0.9735 on GSM8K math, and 0.9675 on function calls.

8
00:00:28,815 --> 00:00:34,561
Free on the Gemini API free tier, or on your own GPU.

9
00:00:35,161 --> 00:00:36,327
Question two.

10
00:00:36,327 --> 00:00:42,428
Is the work easy, such as short questions and simple function calls?

11
00:00:42,428 --> 00:00:49,694
Use 3.5 Flash-Lite, at 66 cents per thousand math problems, and 1.1 seconds each.

12
00:00:49,694 --> 00:00:53,014
Or use 3.8 Flash, for a higher score:

13
00:00:53,014 --> 00:00:53,642
0.9788.

14
00:00:54,242 --> 00:00:55,411
Question three.

15
00:00:55,411 --> 00:01:00,478
Does it need high thinking, where you would otherwise use Carbon?

16
00:01:00,478 --> 00:01:02,583
Use Gemini 4 Neon, at high.

17
00:01:02,583 --> 00:01:07,571
It matched Carbon's score on hard math, for 0.73 times the cost.

18
00:01:07,571 --> 00:01:09,442
That's about 73 percent.

19
00:01:10,042 --> 00:01:11,254
Question four.

20
00:01:11,254 --> 00:01:13,851
Is response time the priority?

21
00:01:13,851 --> 00:01:17,746
Use Gemini 4 Hydrogen, at its lowest setting.

22
00:01:17,746 --> 00:01:22,506
It solved 30 of 30 hard problems, at 11.3 seconds each.

23
00:01:22,506 --> 00:01:24,843
The fastest Gemini 4 model.

24
00:01:25,443 --> 00:01:29,704
Otherwise, use Gemini 4 Argon, at its lowest setting.

25
00:01:29,704 --> 00:01:33,885
It solved 30 of 30 hard problems, at 1.8 cents each.

26
00:01:33,885 --> 00:01:36,137
The cheapest Gemini 4 model.

27
00:01:36,137 --> 00:01:41,524
From December 1st, when Argon's price doubles, Hydrogen is cheaper.

28
00:01:42,124 --> 00:01:48,525
On these tests the four Gemini 4 models tie on accuracy, so price and speed decide among them.

29
00:01:48,525 --> 00:01:52,884
The full numbers and the method are in the article linked below.
